# Normalise all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Simon commits through SourceTree on Windows over \\wsl$, which has previously
# rewritten the entire tree to CRLF and produced a 100-file whitespace diff.
# eol=lf checks files out as LF on every platform, so that cannot recur.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary

# Dev-only files: committed on purpose, but neither a source archive
# (git archive / GitHub "Download ZIP") nor a release should carry them.
# The XenForo release zip is a separate surface again — see build.json.
/CLAUDE.md        export-ignore
/CLAUDE.local.md  export-ignore
/TESTING.md       export-ignore
/.gitattributes   export-ignore
/.gitignore       export-ignore
